  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Livelihoods and Food Security Fund (LIFT 3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Livelihoods and Food Security Fund (LIFT 3) - The action implements the Council Conclusions of February 2021 by supporting the basic needs of the Myanmar people. It builds social and economic resilience of rural and peri-urban areas, especially communities depending on agriculture. It will focus on two target groups in these areas: the most vulnerable populations, and Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises (MSMEs) as engines of growth in the agriculture sector. It will strengthen sustainable livelihoods, food/nutrition security, and MSME&#xbf;s resilience and competitiveness in rural and peri-urban areas of Myanmar.</narrative>
  </description>
